{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Six.</b> And he further added to explain, for six days are permitted to do work. And the word יעשה comes with מלאכה — perhaps the word כל is missing, or [it is] דבר מעשה. And behold, the reason is: if one does work publicly, they put him to death."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:36.919640775Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}